        {
          "text": "Halafu Jakobo waambira Simioni na Lawi, “Mkanibwagira likuni ra adudu; sambi Akanani na Aperizi, ambao ni enyezi a tsi hino, andanizira. Swiswi hu achache tu, ichikala andagbwirana edze ahupige, phahi, andahuangamiza hosi.” ",
